---
import LifeShell from '../../components/LifeShell.astro';
import RetreatCard from '../../components/RetreatCard.astro';
import RaceList from '../../components/RaceList.astro';
import { pastWithPhotos } from '../../data/life';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const latest = pastWithPhotos[0];
---
<LifeShell current="overview" title="Life · Eva Harboe" description="Eva Harboe on yoga, running and retreats: teaching, races, and building communities around moving well.">
  <header class="intro">
    <p class="kicker">Yoga · Running · Retreats</p>
    <h1>Off the <em>screen.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Yoga classes, races and retreats: the things I spend my time on away from a screen, and the
      people I get to do them with.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Yoga</h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        I trained at House of Om in Ubud, Bali, and now teach weekly classes for the Surrey Yoga Society, mostly
        rocket or power vinyasa, with the odd slow, yin-style stretch. Classes are open to complete beginners.
      </p>
      <dl class="figures">
        <div><dt>200hr</dt><dd>YTT certified</dd></div>
        <div><dt>~40</dt><dd>students a week</dd></div>
        <div><dt>4</dt><dd>retreats planned</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a class="more" href={`${base}life/yoga/`}>More on my yoga →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Retreats</h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Retreats are where it all comes together. The most recent one:</p>
      {latest && <RetreatCard r={latest} teaser />}
      <a class="more" href={`${base}life/retreats/`}>All retreats and what's next →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Running</h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Until April 2026, 500 metres was the furthest I'd ever run.</p>
      <RaceList limit={2} />
      <a class="more" href={`${base}life/running/`}>All races →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">About me</h2>
    <div class="content">
      <p>
        I was born in China and grew up in Stavanger, on Norway's west coast, in a Norwegian-French family.
        Most weekends we'd head up to the family cabin to ski in winter and hike the rest of the year, so being
        outside was never something I had to plan.
      </p>
      <a class="more" href={`${base}life/about/`}>Read the rest →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</LifeShell>
